# Corpus licence — not settled yet

This file is the one the sibling repositories use for the *data* licence
(`phishvn` and `phishvn-infra` carry CC BY 4.0 here, and MIT in `LICENSE-CODE`).
It is deliberately not a licence yet.

**No corpus exists.** Nothing has been collected, there is no ethics approval,
and the consent form has not been shown to anyone. A licence granted now would
be a grant over messages that contributors have not yet been asked about, and
the terms they consent to are part of what the consent form has to state before
it is handed out — not something chosen afterwards to fit what was gathered.

The licence is decided at deposit, written into `CONSENT_vi.md` before the first
message is collected, and replaces this file then.

The code in this repository is MIT; see `LICENSE-CODE`.
